<title>USA: No bids for surplus U.S. chrysotile asbestos.</title>
<headline>No bids for surplus U.S. chrysotile asbestos.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>No bids were submitted for surplus U.S.-owned chrysotile asbestos at a monthly bid opening, Defense National Stockpile said Monday.</p>
<p>Bid opening was held on Wednesday. Next bid opening was set for Oct 9 at 1400 Eastern at the agency's offices in suburban Fort Belvoir, Va.</p>
</text>
